@DSDOConnor Thanks for trying Tavus, Daniel.

That isn’t Griffin in your video. That’s a PAL running on an older version of Phoenix (one of our other models). 

Griffin isn’t publicly available yet.

@WhyNotLib @hassaanraza It does both: Griffin sees and hears you in real time, picking up on facial expressions, gaze and tone of voice to guide how it responds. 

It keeps watching and listening even while it’s speaking.

You can read more about it here: https://t.co/FHNOyTXnjR
